  "name": "Face Stealer (Ex)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Quick Disguise thief talent</p><p>When the thief inflicts damage on a foe of the same type as the thief, that drops the foe to negative hit points, as a swift action the thief can assume the appearance of that target as if using the disguise self spell. The thief keeps the stolen face until she takes a new face from another victim, she dismisses it (as a free action), or she runs out of duration for stolen faces for the day. The thief can use face stealer for a maximum of 10 minutes per day per thief level.</p>",
